@Traidn Daily spot market gyrations are noise—they don&#39;t reflect the structural realities driving $SNDK or the broader NAND market. Focusing on single-session ticks on the spot market misses the point for 3 reasons: 

1) The spot market represents a fraction of total memory volume, mainly driven by short-term channel clearing &amp; residual buyers. 

